cspcombine is a combined, rewritten version of two local projects:

  * vipnet-extract-data / ViPNet extraction and container builder
    (https://github.com/kmvi/vipnet-extract-data)
  * cp-extract / ExtractPkey2, CryptoPro file-container extraction
    (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2017 kmvi)

The Streebog lookup tables in cspcombine_lib/streebog_tables.py are copied
from the vipnet project.  The container layouts and algorithm conventions
follow the reference C# and Python implementations in those projects.

The CryptoPro container check-value formulas were cross-checked against the
open-source WebCrypto GOST project (waves-enterprise/crypto-gost-js) and
validated against the stock CryptoPro CSP with csptest.

The original project directories were not modified.
